      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIOGO KEEPING (5) was in the placings last time but prior to that he posted a convincing 22.50 win over 400m at Gawler. Rates on top and can find winning form again. VICTA WALLY (4) struggled for best form latest, finishing 6th (31.21) in a Grade 5 at Angle Park. Has never missed the frame here at the trip including one win. Key player if finds best. WATCH AND SEE (2) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 3.5 lengths from the winner (17.00). Solid formlines coming through his last run. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. TRIO OF CLOWNS (8) comes off a (22.93) win last time, scoring by a nose in a OPEN over 400m at Gawler. Has already won four times from this draw.",
